{
  "version": 1,
  "readme": [
    "Shared rules and test vectors for server folder names. This file is identical in the control plane and the daemon; check:contract-drift compares the two byte for byte.",
    "rules: the data both src/contracts/directory-names.ts files must match (a test in each repo checks it).",
    "owner: shape is the rule in this file; valid also refuses the host account names each repo keeps in its own list (root, admin, ftp, git).",
    "defaultNames: the folder name built from a domain. ascii is the Punycode form (null when the input is not a domain), name is the default (null when ascii is null). When the name is cut, the 8 hash characters are the start of the SHA-256 of ascii exactly as typed after lowercasing, with a leading *. still in place.",
    "collisionSuffix: base plus -n for n from 2 to 99, the base cut so the whole name stays within 63 characters. firstFree: the first free name, null when -99 is also taken.",
    "folderRefs: host is the path under /srv/users. badFolderRefs must all be refused."
  ],
  "rules": {
    "ownerNameRe": "^[a-z_][a-z0-9_-]{0,27}$",
    "ownerNameMaxLength": 28,
    "environmentNameRe": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9_-]{0,31}$",
    "environmentNameMaxLength": 32,
    "folderNameRe": "^[a-z0-9]([a-z0-9._-]{0,61}[a-z0-9])?$",
    "folderNameMaxLength": 63,
    "projectSlugRe": "^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{0,39}$",
    "projectSlugMaxLength": 40,
    "pathIdRe": "^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$",
    "tableNameRe": "^[a-z]+$",
    "commonScope": "common",
    "reservedScopeNames": [
      "common",
      "home",
      "tmp",
      "services",
      "volumes",
      "data",
      "sites",
      "backup",
      "backups",
      "logs",
      "cache",
      "run",
      "var",
      "etc",
      "bin",
      "root",
      "public",
      "releases",
      "current",
      "shared",
      "lost-found",
      "tmp-staging"
    ],
    "ownerReservedPrefixes": ["tp", "systemd-"],
    "ownerReservedSuffix": "-grp",
    "defaultNameCutLength": 54,
    "defaultNameHashLength": 8,
    "collisionSuffixMin": 2,
    "collisionSuffixMax": 99
  },
